  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collective AAP mechanism in Syria operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project under the AAP envelope in the current round. The project intends to establish a collective mechanism in NW and NE Syria. In the NW, capitalizing on the existing collective call center, the project will double it with a community-based feedback mechanism, whereas in the NE the call center will be set up following the NW model.</narrative>
  </description>
